 "h1": "英文格線產生器：輸入單字或名字，做四線三格描寫練習單",
 "title": "英文格線產生器：輸入單字、名字，做四線三格描寫練習單｜埃森美語",
 "desc": "英文格線產生器：輸入孩子的名字、單字或句子，馬上做出四線三格描寫練習單；可選印刷體或草寫、灰色字或空心字，A4 直接列印或存成 PDF，也能只印空白格線紙。",
 "hero": "市面上的英文練習本，字都是別人選的。這個產生器讓你自己決定要練什麼：孩子的英文名字、這週的單字、課本的句子，打進去就變成一張<strong>四線三格描寫練習單</strong>，字母剛好落在正確的格子裡，可以直接列印或存成 PDF。只想要空白格線紙也行。",
 "css": "@font-face{font-family:'Playwrite US Trad';font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/playwriteustrad/v11/fdNX9tyHsnVPjW9trmV7wQ0stdwRBYclCsCdzOb1-cd1E8tgiqKf5uFFig.woff2) format('woff2')}.wsm{max-width:980px;margin:18px auto 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,340px) minmax(0,1fr);gap:18px;align-items:start}@media(max-width:860px){.wsm{grid-template-columns:1fr}}.wsm-ctl{background:#fff;border-radius:20px;box-shadow:var(--card-shadow);padding:16px}.wsm-ctl label,.wsm-ctl legend{display:block;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);font-size:14.5px;margin:10px 0 6px}.wsm-ctl textarea,.wsm-ctl input[type=text],.wsm-ctl select{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;font-size:16px;padding:10px 12px;border:2px solid rgba(26,39,82,.15);border-radius:12px;font-family:inherit}.wsm-ctl fieldset{border:none;margin:0;padding:0}.wsm-seg{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.wsm-seg label{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;margin:0;font-weight:500;background:#F4FAFF;border:1px solid rgba(26,39,82,.15);border-radius:999px;padding:6px 12px;cursor:pointer}.wsm-seg input{accent-color:var(--navy)}.wsm-chk{display:flex!important;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-weight:500!important}.wsm-btns{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-top:14px}.wsm-btns button{font-family:inherit}.wsm-btns .alt{background:#fff;border:2px solid var(--light-blue);color:var(--navy);border-radius:100px;padding:10px 16px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}.wsm-prev{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}.wsm-sheet{background:#fff;box-shadow:var(--card-shadow);border-radius:6px;aspect-ratio:186/273;width:100%}.wsm-sheet svg{display:block;width:100%;height:100%}.wsm-hint{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px;line-height:1.6}#wsm-print-root{display:none}@media print{@page{size:A4;margin:12mm}body>*:not(#wsm-print-root){display:none!important}#wsm-print-root{display:block}#wsm-print-root .wsm-sheet{box-shadow:none;border-radius:0;width:186mm;height:273mm;aspect-ratio:auto;break-after:page;page-break-after:always}}",
