  {
   "title": "做一張自己的四線三格練習單",
   "prose": [
    "左邊輸入內容、選字體和樣式，右邊會即時出現 A4 預覽。小寫字母的身體剛好佔中間一格，b、d、h 這類高的字母和所有大寫碰到第一條線，g、p、y 往下碰到第四條線，跟學校教的四線三格一樣。草寫用的是美國小學的草寫字型，寫法說明見 <a href=\"/english-cursive/\">英文草寫 A–Z</a>；26 個字母的現成練習單在 <a href=\"/english-alphabet-worksheet/\">英文字母練習單</a>。"
   ],
   "html": "<div class=\"wsm\" id=\"wsm\"><div class=\"wsm-ctl\"><label for=\"wsm-text\">練習內容（一行一個字、名字或句子）</label><textarea id=\"wsm-text\" rows=\"5\" spellcheck=\"false\">Amy\napple\nI like dogs.</textarea><fieldset><legend>字體</legend><div class=\"wsm-seg\"><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"wsm-font\" value=\"print\" checked>印刷體</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"wsm-font\" value=\"cursive\">草寫</label></div></fieldset><fieldset><legend>描寫樣式</legend><div class=\"wsm-seg\"><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"wsm-style\" value=\"fill\" checked>灰色字</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"wsm-style\" value=\"outline\">空心字</label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"wsm-style\" value=\"dash\">虛線字</label></div></fieldset><label for=\"wsm-size\">格線大小</label><select id=\"wsm-size\"><option value=\"10\">大（國小低年級）</option><option value=\"8\" selected>中（中年級）</option><option value=\"6\">小（高年級以上）</option></select><label for=\"wsm-extra\">每行描寫字下面加幾行空白</label><select id=\"wsm-extra\"><option value=\"0\">不加</option><option value=\"1\" selected>1 行</option><option value=\"2\">2 行</option></select><label class=\"wsm-chk\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"wsm-rep\" checked>描寫字重複排滿一整行</label><label class=\"wsm-chk\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"wsm-head\" checked>上方加 Name／Date 欄</label><label for=\"wsm-title\">標題（選填）</label><input type=\"text\" id=\"wsm-title\" maxlength=\"40\" placeholder=\"例如 Unit 3 Animals\"><div class=\"wsm-btns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" id=\"wsm-print\">列印／存成 PDF</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"alt\" id=\"wsm-blank\">只要空白四線三格紙</button></div><p class=\"wsm-hint\">按「列印」後，印表機選「另存為 PDF」就能存檔。右邊是 A4 預覽，改內容會自動更新。</p></div><div class=\"wsm-prev\" id=\"wsm-prev\" aria-label=\"練習單預覽\"></div></div><script>(function(){var V='843e5c9f',G=null,$=function(i){return document.getElementById(i);},prev=$('wsm-prev'),made=0,t0=null;\nvar W=186,Hh=273,X0=3;\nfunction opt(n){var e=document.querySelector('input[name=\"'+n+'\"]:checked');return e?e.value:null;}\nfunction glyphs(){return G||(G=fetch('/assets/worksheet-glyphs.json?v='+V).then(function(r){return r.json();}).then(function(j){return j.g;}));}\nvar cv=document.createElement('canvas').getContext('2d'),xr=null;\nfunction cursiveX(){if(xr)return xr;cv.font=\"100px 'Playwrite US Trad'\";var m=cv.measureText('x').actualBoundingBoxAscent;xr=m>0?m/100:0.38;return xr;}\nfunction width(txt,g,cur,gl){if(cur){var F=g/cursiveX();cv.font=F+\"px 'Playwrite US Trad'\";return cv.measureText(txt).width;}\n var w=0;for(var i=0;i<txt.length;i++){var c=gl[txt[i]]||gl['?'];w+=c[0]*g/100;}return w;}\nfunction esc(s){return s.replace(/[&<>\"]/g,function(c){return {'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;'}[c];});}\nfunction lines(y,g){var s='',i;for(i=0;i<4;i++)s+='<line x1=\"0\" x2=\"'+W+'\" y1=\"'+(y+i*g).toFixed(2)+'\" y2=\"'+(y+i*g).toFixed(2)+'\" stroke=\"#8c9bb3\" stroke-width=\"'+(i==1?0.25:0.3)+'\"'+(i==1?' stroke-dasharray=\"2 1.6\"':'')+'/>';return s;}\nfunction paint(style,unit){var sw=(0.32*unit).toFixed(3);\n if(style==='fill')return 'fill=\"#b8c2d0\"';\n if(style==='dash')return 'fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5f6f88\" stroke-width=\"'+sw+'\" stroke-dasharray=\"'+(1.1*unit).toFixed(2)+' '+(0.8*unit).toFixed(2)+'\"';\n return 'fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5f6f88\" stroke-width=\"'+sw+'\"';}\nfunction textAt(txt,x,base,g,cur,style,gl){\n if(cur){var F=g/cursiveX();return '<text x=\"'+x.toFixed(2)+'\" y=\"'+base.toFixed(2)+'\" font-family=\"Playwrite US Trad\" font-size=\"'+F.toFixed(2)+'\" '+paint(style,1)+'>'+esc(txt)+'</text>';}\n var s='',k=g/100,u=1/k;for(var i=0;i<txt.length;i++){var c=gl[txt[i]];if(!c){x+=g*0.6;continue;}\n  if(c[1])s+='<path d=\"'+c[1]+'\" transform=\"translate('+x.toFixed(2)+','+base.toFixed(2)+') scale('+k.toFixed(4)+','+(-k).toFixed(4)+')\" '+paint(style,u)+'/>';x+=c[0]*k;}\n return s;}\nfunction wrap(t,g,cur,gl,avail){var ws=t.split(/\\s+/),out=[],cur_='';ws.forEach(function(w){var tryS=cur_?cur_+' '+w:w;if(width(tryS,g,cur,gl)<=avail||!cur_)cur_=tryS;else{out.push(cur_);cur_=w;}});if(cur_)out.push(cur_);return out;}\nasync function build(blankOnly){var gl=await glyphs();var cur=opt('wsm-font')==='cursive';if(cur){try{await document.fonts.load(\"40px 'Playwrite US Trad'\");}catch(e){}}\n var style=opt('wsm-style')||'fill',g=+($('wsm-size').value),extra=+($('wsm-extra').value),rep=$('wsm-rep').checked,head=$('wsm-head').checked,title=$('wsm-title').value.trim();\n var pitch=g*3+g*0.9,avail=W-2*X0,items=[];\n if(blankOnly){var n=Math.floor((Hh-(head?16:4))/pitch);for(var i=0;i<n;i++)items.push(null);}\n else{$('wsm-text').value.split('\\n').map(function(s){return s.trim();}).filter(Boolean).slice(0,30).forEach(function(t){\n  wrap(t,g,cur,gl,avail).forEach(function(part){var w=width(part,g,cur,gl),txt=part;\n   if(rep){var gapw=g*1.2,n=Math.max(1,Math.floor((avail+gapw)/(w+gapw)));items.push({t:part,n:n,w:w,gap:gapw});}else items.push({t:part,n:1,w:w,gap:0});\n   for(var e=0;e<extra;e++)items.push(null);});});}\n var sheets=[],body='',y=0,top=(head||title)?(title?20:14):4;\n function open(){body='';y=top;}\n function close(){var hd='';\n  if(title)hd+='<text x=\"'+(W/2)+'\" y=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"DM Sans,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"6\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1A2752\">'+esc(title)+'</text>';\n  if(head){var hy=title?16:10;hd+='<text x=\"'+X0+'\" y=\"'+hy+'\" font-family=\"DM Sans,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"4.2\" fill=\"#1A2752\">Name: ____________________</text><text x=\"'+(W-X0)+'\" y=\"'+hy+'\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"DM Sans,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"4.2\" fill=\"#1A2752\">Date: ______________</text>';}\n  hd+='<text x=\"'+(W/2)+'\" y=\"'+(Hh-1.5)+'\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"DM Sans,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"2.6\" fill=\"#a3adbd\">americanenglish.com.tw/english-worksheet-maker/</text>';\n  sheets.push('<svg viewBox=\"0 0 '+W+' '+Hh+'\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">'+hd+body+'</svg>');}\n open();\n items.forEach(function(it){if(y+pitch>Hh-5){close();open();}\n  body+=lines(y+g*0.45,g);\n  if(it){var x=X0,base=y+g*0.45+2*g;for(var r=0;r<it.n;r++){body+=textAt(it.t,x,base,g,cur,style,gl);x+=it.w+it.gap;}}\n  y+=pitch;});\n if(body||!sheets.length)close();\n prev.innerHTML=sheets.map(function(s){return '<div class=\"wsm-sheet\">'+s+'</div>';}).join('');\n if(window.gtag){clearTimeout(t0);t0=setTimeout(function(){if(made<10){made++;gtag('event','worksheet_make',{page_path:location.pathname,font:cur?'cursive':'print',style:style,blank:!!blankOnly});}},1500);}\n return sheets;}\nasync function doPrint(blank){var sheets=await build(blank);var r=$('wsm-print-root');if(!r){r=document.createElement('div');r.id='wsm-print-root';document.body.appendChild(r);}\n r.innerHTML=sheets.map(function(s){return '<div class=\"wsm-sheet\">'+s+'</div>';}).join('');\n if(window.gtag)gtag('event','worksheet_print',{page_path:location.pathname,pages:sheets.length,blank:!!blank});\n setTimeout(function(){window.print();},150);}\nvar tm=null;function soon(){clearTimeout(tm);tm=setTimeout(function(){build(false);},250);}\ndocument.querySelectorAll('#wsm input,#wsm textarea,#wsm select').forEach(function(e){e.addEventListener('input',soon);e.addEventListener('change',soon);});\n$('wsm-print').addEventListener('click',function(){doPrint(false);});$('wsm-blank').addEventListener('click',function(){doPrint(true);});\nbuild(false);})();</script>"
  },
  {
   "title": "四線三格怎麼寫：每個字母佔哪幾格",
   "phone_cols": 3,
   "prose": [
    "四條線由上到下叫第一線到第四線，中間是三格。寫字母時記住三件事：<strong>大寫字母都寫在上面兩格</strong>、<strong>小寫字母的身體在中間那一格</strong>、<strong>有尾巴的小寫往下伸到第三格</strong>。"
   ],
   "heads": [
    "字母",
    "佔哪幾格",
    "寫的時候注意"
   ],
   "rows": [
    [
     "A–Z 所有大寫",
     "上面兩格",
     "從第一線寫到第三線，不往下伸"
    ],
    [
     "a c e m n o r s u v w x z",
     "中間一格",
     "碰到第二線和第三線，不出格"
    ],
    [
     "b d f h k l",
     "上面兩格",
     "直線從第一線往下寫到第三線"
    ],
    [
     "t",
     "上面兩格（矮一點）",
     "頂端在第一格的一半，比 l 矮"
    ],
    [
     "i j",
     "點在第一格",
     "點和身體分開，點在第一格中間"
    ],
    [
     "g j p q y",
     "中間＋下面一格",
     "尾巴往下碰到第四線"
    ],
    [
     "0–9 數字",
     "上面兩格",
     "和大寫一樣高"
    ]
   ],
   "after": [
    "最常見的錯誤是小寫寫太大：a、e、o 長到第一格，或 g、y 的尾巴沒有往下。練習時先描灰色字，再在下面的空白行自己寫一次，對照有沒有出格。字母的唸法和順序見 <a href=\"/english-alphabet-guide/\">英文字母表</a>，字母代表的聲音見 <a href=\"/phonics-rules-chart/\">自然發音規則表</a>。"
   ]
  },
